@comment{
  Add your papers below as BibTeX entries. They appear automatically on the
  publications page, grouped by year. Useful extra fields:
    selected    = {true}       also show it under "selected publications" on the home page
    abbr        = {NeurIPS}    venue badge (colors/links live in _data/venues.yml)
    pdf         = {paper.pdf}  file in assets/pdf/ (or a full URL)
    code        = {https://github.com/...}
    html        = {https://...} project / publisher page
    arxiv       = {2401.00000}
    bibtex_show = {true}       adds a "Bib" button
    abstract    = {...}        adds an "Abs" button
    preview     = {fig.png}    thumbnail from assets/img/publication_preview/

  Example (copy it out of this comment block and edit):

  inproceedings{pain2026example,
    abbr        = {Venue},
    title       = {Paper Title},
    author      = {Pain, Krishnendu and Coauthor, A.},
    booktitle   = {Proceedings of ...},
    year        = {2026},
    pdf         = {pain2026example.pdf},
    code        = {https://github.com/krishnendu-pain/...},
    bibtex_show = {true},
    selected    = {true}
  }
  (put an "at" sign before "inproceedings" when you copy it)
}
